  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sunly AS Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment of up to EUR 67 million in the context of the capital  increase of Sunly AS (Sunly, Company), an Estonia based renewable energy  developer and independent power producer with operations in Poland and the  Baltic countries. The Bank has initially committed EUR 30 million to purchase a  minority equity stake in the company in 2023 and is extending its participation  by another up to EUR 37 million in 2024. The investment is part of a capital  increase of EUR 260m (combined), of which the investment fund Mirova has taken  a substantial stake.  The capital increase is mainly aimed at financing the Company&apos;s deployment of  renewable energy capacities over the next 36 months.</narrative>
  </description>
